            "title": "Explicit port 0 is omitted from the netloc",
            "description": "The change from checking `self.port is not None` to checking truthiness causes an explicitly specified port of `0` to be treated as if no port were provided. Port 0 is a valid explicit port value, so `netloc` incorrectly returns only the host instead of `host:0`, changing the URL authority and potentially causing requests to target the default port rather than port 0.",
